<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 pt-14 pb-10">
  <div class="grid items-start gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold leading-tight tracking-tight md:text-5xl">
        Know when to worry about
        <span class="text-brand">you and your baby</span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-5 max-w-readable text-lg leading-relaxed text-slate-700">
        In the first year after birth, some signs need a health worker straight away and
        some can wait. MamaTriage asks you a few short questions and tells you which
        it is.
      </p>

      <p class="mt-4 max-w-readable text-slate-600">
        Chat on <strong>Telegram</strong> or <strong>WhatsApp</strong>, in English or
        Pidgin. No app to download.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a href="/register" class="btn-primary">Get started — it is free</a>
        <a href="#how" class="btn-ghost">How it works</a>
      </div>

      <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-slate-500">
        We only ask for a name. A phone number is needed only if you choose WhatsApp.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-slate-500">
        What you get back
      </p>

      <ul class="mt-4 space-y-4">
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-0.5 h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-urgent"></span>
          <span>
            <strong class="block">Go now</strong>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-600">
              Danger signs that need a health facility immediately.
            </span>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-0.5 h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-warn"></span>
          <span>
            <strong class="block">See someone today</strong>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-600">
              Needs a health worker within 24 hours, but is not an emergency.
            </span>
          </span>
        </li>
        <li class="flex gap-3">
          <span class="mt-0.5 h-3 w-3 shrink-0 rounded-full bg-calm"></span>
          <span>
            <strong class="block">Care at home</strong>
            <span class="text-sm text-slate-600">
              With clear guidance, and the signs that mean come back.
            </span>
          </span>
        </li>
      </ul>

      <p class="mt-5 border-t border-slate-200 pt-4 text-sm text-slate-600">
        Every answer says what to watch for and when to seek help again.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="how" class="border-y border-slate-200 bg-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-14">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">How it works</h2>

    <ol class="mt-8 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
      <li>
        <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-light font-bold text-brand">1</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Choose where to chat</h3>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          Telegram or WhatsApp. Tell us what to call you — a first name or nickname
          is fine.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-light font-bold text-brand">2</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Answer a few questions</h3>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          About you, or about your baby. One question at a time, in your own words.
          English or Pidgin.
        </p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <span class="flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-brand-light font-bold text-brand">3</span>
        <h3 class="mt-3 font-semibold">Get a clear answer</h3>
        <p class="mt-1.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-600">
          Go now, see someone today, or care at home — with what to do and what to
          watch for.
        </p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-5 py-14">
  <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">What this is, and what it is not</h2>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-slate-700">
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink">It is a research prototype.</strong>
          It is being built and tested as part of an MSc project. It is not a medical
          service and has not been approved as one.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink">It is not a doctor.</strong>
          It does not diagnose anything and it will never tell you which medicine to take
          or how much.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink">It covers mothers and babies in the first year.</strong>
          Postpartum mothers, and infants from birth to 12 months. For anyone else, it
          will say so and point you to a health worker.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink">It errs on the side of caution.</strong>
          If it is unsure, it will tell you to get seen. That is deliberate.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Your privacy</h2>

      <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-slate-700">
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink">We ask for as little as possible.</strong>
          A name to call you. Nothing else is required.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink">Telegram needs no phone number at all.</strong>
          We only ever ask for one if you choose WhatsApp, because that is the only way
          to reach you there.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink">Numbers are scrambled before they are stored.</strong>
          They are never kept in a form anyone can read back.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong class="text-ink">Conversations are stored anonymously</strong>
          so the system can be checked and improved. You will be asked before anything is
          kept.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-12 rounded-2xl bg-brand p-8 text-center text-white">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Ready to start?</h2>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-readable text-brand-light">
      It takes about a minute. You can stop at any time.
    </p>
    <a href="/register"
       class="btn mt-6 bg-white text-brand hover:bg-brand-light focus:ring-white/40">
      Register
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
